The TypeScript in this package (keygen/sign/verify wrappers and Algorand
falcon_verify LogicSig address derivation) and the falcon_wasm.c wrapper are
authored by AlgoVoi and licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The bundled WebAssembly binary (wasm/falcon.wasm) is an Emscripten build of the
Algorand Falcon-1024 C library (github.com/algorand/falcon), which is provided
under the MIT license. Falcon is the basis for NIST's FN-DSA standard (draft
FIPS 206); this binary implements Algorand's deterministic Falcon-1024 variant,
which is not identical to the FN-DSA standard.

